{"sections":[{"slug":"Grothendieck构造","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Grothendieck构造"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">构造</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Grothendieck 构造"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$, Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">构造将函子</span> $F\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathsf{Cat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">等同于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/纤维范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $p\\colon \\mathcal E \\to \\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">其在</span> $x\\in\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">处的纤维为</span> $F(x)$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">范畴的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有万有的纤维范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这也是一种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分类空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分类空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的观念</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}